{
  "name": "@cordis-studio/canvas-ui",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "dependencies": {
    "@cordis-notebook/host": "workspace:*",
    "@cordis-studio/canvas": "workspace:*"
  },
  "cordis": {
    "capabilities": [
      {
        "service": "canvasUI",
        "side": "client",
        "description": "画布菜单、卡片视图和扩展区域",
        "contracts": [
          "types/client.d.ts"
        ],
        "examples": [
          "examples/menu.js"
        ],
        "lifecycle": [
          "register/menu/extend/settings 都传入 owner 管理释放；菜单按 order 排序。",
          "卡片可用 selectionActions(nodes, view) 提供单选或多选操作、selectionGroup(node, view) 扩展快捷选择，并用 preserveDOM 声明刷新时是否复用已挂载 DOM；view.syncRenderedNode 同步渲染快照，避免依赖 CanvasSession 内部缓存。extend 注册时立即 refresh，但不强制重绘；refresh 应兼顾已有卡片和声明保留 DOM 的 renderer，card 处理新卡片，dispose 移除自有节点。完整模板见 task=studio-extension。",
          "settings 的 render 返回清理函数，refresh 在打开设置时调用；私有持久化与迟到响应保护见 task=studio-settings 配方。"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "id": "canvas-ui",
    "name": "画布界面",
    "description": "画布界面",
    "defaultEnabled": true,
    "order": 10,
    "requires": {
      "server": [],
      "client": [
        "canvasSession"
      ]
    },
    "provides": {
      "server": [],
      "client": [
        "canvasUI"
      ]
    },
    "build": [
      {
        "type": "bundle",
        "input": "client.js",
        "output": "client.js",
        "platform": "browser"
      },
      {
        "type": "copy",
        "input": "style.css",
        "output": "style.css"
      }
    ],
    "client": "client.js",
    "public": [
      "client.js",
      "style.css"
    ],
    "styles": [
      "style.css"
    ]
  },
  "exports": {
    "./client": {
      "types": "./types/client.d.ts"
    }
  }
}
